### ============================================================
### CampusLibrary: Borrow loans with Reader login
###
### Preconditions:
### - Reader users already exist in the IdentityAccessServer.
### - fachliche Readers are already provisioned in CampusLibraryApi.
### - Reader profiles are completed.
### - Books and BookItems already exist.
###
### This file only logs in each reader and creates loans.
### It is not idempotent: running it twice will usually create
### conflicts because BookItems are already borrowed.
### ============================================================

### Common configuration ========================================
@baseUrl = https://localhost:8010/camplib/v1
@authServer = https://localhost:7010
@devClientId = dev-token-client
@apiScope = campus_library_api
@password = Geh1m_


